# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AcademyOS frontend configuration
#
# Copy to .env.local for local overrides. Every VITE_* value is inlined into
# the JS bundle at BUILD time, so it is public: never put secrets here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OPTIONAL — normally leave this EMPTY.
#
# AcademyOS deploys as a SINGLE Vercel project: the Vite SPA plus the Express
# API as a serverless function under /api/*. Frontend and API therefore share
# one origin, relative /api/... requests are correct, and the auth cookies stay
# first-party. Leaving this blank is the supported production setup.
#
# Local development also wants it empty: the Vite dev server proxies
# /api -> http://127.0.0.1:4000 (see vite.config.ts).
#
# Only set it when the API really is on a different domain, e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
# and remember the backend then needs CLIENT_URL + COOKIE_SECURE=true +
# COOKIE_SAMESITE=none so third-party cookies survive.
#
# Never set it to the frontend's own URL.
VITE_API_URL=
